# Logos Folder

Store app logos and branding images here.

## Files
- `app_logo.png` - Main app logo
- `app_logo_white.png` - White variant for dark backgrounds
- `bizflow_logo.png` - Full BizFlow branding logo
- `bizflow_icon.png` - App icon

## Usage

```dart
Image.asset('assets/images/logos/app_logo.png')
```
